  "description": "From the creator of Hook, Line, and Sinker comes its hilarious sequel! \n\nNow that Kye-Soo and Myung-Tae are free of Kang Shin-Joo, he has his eyes set his next target - Myung-Tae’s older brother, Young-Joo. And while Young-Joo doesn’t exactly reciprocate the interest, he’s having a hard time forgetting the particularly…perky aspects of Shin-Joo’s undeniably flawless physique. Will the smarmy schemer Shin-Joo be able to use his charisma to reel in his bait this time? Or is this relationship dead in the water before it even begins?\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
